the example: capture at the first step only
{"id":1,"sequenceMatchEventsAllWithCapture('(?1)(?t>=1&&t<=7)(?2)')(t, bitTest(e, 0), bitTest(e, 1), CAST(map('somefield', product, 'someotherfield', toString(price)), 'JSON'), NULL)":[[{"t":0,"capture":{"somefield":"shoes","someotherfield":"10"}},{"t":7,"capture":null}],[{"t":20,"capture":{"somefield":"bag","someotherfield":"30"}},{"t":22,"capture":null}]]}
{"id":2,"sequenceMatchEventsAllWithCapture('(?1)(?t>=1&&t<=7)(?2)')(t, bitTest(e, 0), bitTest(e, 1), CAST(map('somefield', product, 'someotherfield', toString(price)), 'JSON'), NULL)":[[{"t":0,"capture":{"somefield":"shoes","someotherfield":"10"}}]]}
{"id":3,"sequenceMatchEventsAllWithCapture('(?1)(?t>=1&&t<=7)(?2)')(t, bitTest(e, 0), bitTest(e, 1), CAST(map('somefield', product, 'someotherfield', toString(price)), 'JSON'), NULL)":[[{"t":0,"capture":{"somefield":"shoes","someotherfield":"10"}},{"t":5,"capture":null}]]}
all four functions, captures at both steps
{"id":1,"longest":[{"t":0,"capture":{"v":"shoes"}},{"t":7,"capture":{"p":"hat"}}],"first":[{"t":0,"capture":{"v":"shoes"}},{"t":7,"capture":{"p":"hat"}}],"last":[{"t":20,"capture":{"v":"bag"}},{"t":22,"capture":{"p":"bag"}}],"all":[[{"t":0,"capture":{"v":"shoes"}},{"t":7,"capture":{"p":"hat"}}],[{"t":20,"capture":{"v":"bag"}},{"t":22,"capture":{"p":"bag"}}]]}
